From 43ea313f34f62dc4f399987a5863962924500c4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mingzq <north_sea@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 08:36:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] u-boot: fix NULL bootdev deref in rk3576
 rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup

Stage a board patch that gives rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup() the same
android_get_bootdev() -> rockchip_get_bootdev() fallback already present
in fit.c (via 0002) and vendor.c, plus a final NULL guard. Without it,
Armbian boot from NVMe crashes with a Synchronous Abort in the final
fdt fixup because android_get_bootdev() always returns NULL on
non-Android boots.
---
 ...06-rk3576-fdt-fixup-fallback-bootdev.patch | 43 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patch/u-boot/legacy/u-boot-radxa-rk35xx/board_recomputer-rk3576-devkit/0006-rk3576-fdt-fixup-fallback-bootdev.patch

diff --git a/patch/u-boot/legacy/u-boot-radxa-rk35xx/board_recomputer-rk3576-devkit/0006-rk3576-fdt-fixup-fallback-bootdev.patch b/patch/u-boot/legacy/u-boot-radxa-rk35xx/board_recomputer-rk3576-devkit/0006-rk3576-fdt-fixup-fallback-bootdev.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cfa5d04
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patch/u-boot/legacy/u-boot-radxa-rk35xx/board_recomputer-rk3576-devkit/0006-rk3576-fdt-fixup-fallback-bootdev.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Ming Zhangqun <north_sea@qq.com>
+Date: Tue, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] rk3576: fix NULL bootdev deref in rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup
+
+rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup() obtains the bootdev through android_get_bootdev()
+when CONFIG_ANDROID_BOOTLOADER is enabled, but unlike fit.c and vendor.c
+it lacks a fallback to rockchip_get_bootdev(). On non-Android boots (e.g.
+Armbian booted from NVMe), android_get_bootdev() always returns NULL, so
+the following "desc->if_type" dereference raises a Synchronous Abort
+(data translation fault) right before jumping to the kernel.
+
+Add the same android -> rockchip_get_bootdev() fallback used by fit.c and
+vendor.c, plus a final NULL guard that simply skips the UFS fixup (harmless
+on NVMe boot, where no UFS device is present). Fixes the boot crash seen
+on reComputer RK3576 DevKit with secure-boot + A/B OTA.
+
+Signed-off-by: Ming Zhangqun <north_sea@qq.com>
+---
+ arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3576/rk3576.c | 5 +++++
+ 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)
+
+diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3576/rk3576.c b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3576/rk3576.c
+--- a/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3576/rk3576.c
++++ b/arch/arm/mach-rockchip/rk3576/rk3576.c
+@@ -426,5 +426,7 @@ int rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup(const void *blob)
+ #ifdef CONFIG_ANDROID_BOOTLOADER
+ 	struct blk_desc *desc = android_get_bootdev();
++	if (!desc)
++		desc = rockchip_get_bootdev();
+ #else
+ 	struct blk_desc *desc = rockchip_get_bootdev();
+ #endif
+@@ -431,6 +433,9 @@ int rk_board_dm_fdt_fixup(const void *blob)
+ 	const char *status = NULL;
+ 	int node = -1;
+
++	if (!desc)
++		return 0;
++
+ 	/*
+ 	 * 1. Kernel DTS will enable UFS by default.
+ 	 *
